        <<test>>
    }
}

%% Core model

Entity <|-- Player
Entity <|-- Monster

GameWorld --> Player
GameWorld *-- MonsterFactory
GameWorld *-- ThemeRegistry
GameWorld "1" *-- "0..*" DungeonLevel
DungeonLevel "1" *-- "0..*" Room

Room "1" --> "0..*" Monster : monsters
Room "1" --> "0..*" Item : floorItems
Room --> "0..1" Chest
Room --> Room : exits
Player "1" --> "0..*" Item : inventory

%% State pattern: monster lifecycle

Monster --> MonsterState : current state

MonsterState <|.. IdleState
MonsterState <|.. HuntingState
MonsterState <|.. EnragedState
MonsterState <|.. FleeingState
MonsterState <|.. DeadState

MonsterState ..> Monster : lifecycle context
MonsterState ..> Player

IdleState ..> HuntingState : next
IdleState ..> DeadState : next
HuntingState ..> EnragedState : next
HuntingState ..> FleeingState : next
HuntingState ..> DeadState : next
EnragedState ..> FleeingState : next
EnragedState ..> DeadState : next
FleeingState ..> DeadState : next

HuntingState ..> GameConfig : thresholds
EnragedState ..> GameConfig : threshold
EnragedState ..> AggressiveStrategy : installs on entry
FleeingState ..> SkittishStrategy : installs on entry

Combat --> EventBus
Combat ..> MonsterState : lifecycle decisions
Combat ..> CombatStrategy : chooses action
Combat ..> Action : resolves
Combat ..> Monster
Combat ..> Player
Combat ..> Room
Combat ..> DeadState : on death

%% State pattern: game modes

GameContext --> GameState : current mode

GameState <|.. ExploringState
GameState <|.. CombatState
GameState <|.. InventoryState
GameState <|.. GameOverState

GameState ..> GameContext : mode context
GameContext ..> ExploringState : enters
GameContext ..> CombatState : enters
GameContext ..> InventoryState : opens pack
GameContext ..> GameOverState : ends game

%% Strategy pattern

Monster --> CombatStrategy : current strategy

CombatStrategy <|.. AggressiveStrategy
CombatStrategy <|.. RangedStrategy
CombatStrategy <|.. HealerStrategy
CombatStrategy <|.. SkittishStrategy

CombatStrategy ..> Action : returns
CombatStrategy ..> Monster
CombatStrategy ..> Player
CombatStrategy ..> Room

Action --> ActionType : type
Action --> Entity : target

%% Command pattern

Command <|.. AbstractCommand
Command <|.. MacroCommand
Command <|.. SimpleCommand
Command <|.. NoCommand

AbstractCommand <|-- AttackCommand
AbstractCommand <|-- MoveCommand
AbstractCommand <|-- TakeCommand
AbstractCommand <|-- DropCommand
AbstractCommand <|-- UseItemCommand

AbstractCommand --> GameContext : receiver access
AbstractCommand *-- TurnSnapshot : before execution
AttackCommand ..> Combat : player attack
MoveCommand ..> Room : destination
TakeCommand ..> Item
TakeCommand ..> Chest
DropCommand ..> Item
UseItemCommand ..> Potion
UseItemCommand ..> Hourglass
UseItemCommand ..> CommandHistory : rewind

MacroCommand "1" o-- "0..*" Command : children
SimpleCommand --> SimpleCommandBody : callback
NoCommand --> EventBus : reason message
CommandHistory "1" o-- "0..*" Command : undo stack

CommandParser --> CommandFactory : registry
CommandFactory ..> Command : creates
CommandFactory ..> GameContext

CommandParser --> QuestTracker
CommandParser --> AchievementSystem
CommandParser ..> GameContext : allowed verbs
CommandParser ..> Command : returns
CommandParser ..> AttackCommand : creates
CommandParser ..> MoveCommand : creates
CommandParser ..> TakeCommand : creates
CommandParser ..> DropCommand : creates
CommandParser ..> UseItemCommand : creates
CommandParser ..> MacroCommand : loot
CommandParser ..> SimpleCommand : creates
CommandParser ..> NoCommand : rejected input

GameContext --> GameWorld
GameContext --> Player
GameContext --> Room : current room
GameContext --> EventBus
GameContext --> Combat
GameContext --> CommandHistory

%% Memento support for undo

TurnSnapshot --> Player : restores
TurnSnapshot --> Room : restores
TurnSnapshot --> Monster : saved health
TurnSnapshot --> Item : saved collections
TurnSnapshot --> CombatStrategy : saved strategies
TurnSnapshot --> MonsterState : saved states

%% Observer pattern

EventBus "1" o-- "0..*" GameEventListener : subscribers
EventBus ..> GameEvent : publishes
GameEvent --> EventType
GameEventListener ..> GameEvent : receives

GameEventListener <|.. CombatLog
GameEventListener <|.. AchievementSystem
GameEventListener <|.. QuestTracker
GameEventListener <|.. DangerMeter
GameEventListener <|.. ConsolePrinter

AchievementSystem --> EventBus
QuestTracker --> EventBus
DangerMeter --> EventBus
DangerMeter --> Player
QuestTracker "1" *-- "0..*" Quest
Quest --> EventType : trigger
ConsolePrinter *-- CombatLog : formatter

%% Factory patterns

MonsterFactory "1" --> "0..*" MonsterDef : blueprints
MonsterFactory ..> Monster : creates
MonsterFactory ..> CombatStrategy : selects
MonsterFactory ..> AggressiveStrategy : creates
MonsterFactory ..> RangedStrategy : creates
MonsterFactory ..> HealerStrategy : creates
MonsterFactory ..> SkittishStrategy : creates
MonsterFactory ..> Json : reads definitions

ThemeKit <|.. CryptThemeKit
ThemeKit <|.. ForgeThemeKit
ThemeKit <|.. FrostThemeKit
ThemeKit <|.. WinterfellThemeKit

ThemeKit ..> Monster : creates
ThemeKit ..> Item : creates
CryptThemeKit --> MonsterFactory
ForgeThemeKit --> MonsterFactory
FrostThemeKit --> MonsterFactory
WinterfellThemeKit --> MonsterFactory

ThemeRegistry "1" *-- "1..*" ThemeKit : registered themes
ThemeRegistry ..> MonsterFactory : passes to kits

RoomPopulator <|-- StandardRoomPopulator
RoomPopulator <|-- BossRoomPopulator
RoomPopulator <|-- TreasureRoomPopulator

RoomPopulator --> ThemeKit : product family
RoomPopulator ..> Room : populates
RoomPopulator ..> Monster : encounter
RoomPopulator ..> Chest : creates

GameWorld ..> RoomPopulator : population workflow
GameWorld ..> StandardRoomPopulator : creates
GameWorld ..> BossRoomPopulator : creates
GameWorld ..> TreasureRoomPopulator : creates

%% Items

Item <|.. Armor
Item <|.. Weapon
Item <|.. Potion
Item <|.. Treasure
Item <|.. Hourglass
Chest "1" --> "0..*" Item : contents

%% Singleton configuration and randomness

GameConfig ..> Json : parses settings
RandomSource ..> GameConfig : seed
Player ..> GameConfig
GameWorld ..> GameConfig
GameWorld ..> RandomSource

%% Application wiring

Main ..> GameWorld
Main ..> Player
Main ..> EventBus
Main ..> Combat
Main ..> CommandParser
Main ..> CommandHistory
Main ..> GameContext
Main ..> Command : executes
Main ..> ConsolePrinter : creates
Main ..> CombatLog : creates
Main ..> QuestTracker : creates
Main ..> AchievementSystem : creates
Main ..> DangerMeter : creates

%% Test coverage overview

CommandTest ..> CommandParser : tests
CommandTest ..> CommandHistory : tests
CommandTest ..> GameContext : tests
CommandTest ..> TurnSnapshot : undo behavior

FactoryTest ..> MonsterFactory : tests
FactoryTest ..> ThemeRegistry : tests
FactoryTest ..> GameWorld : tests

SingletonTest ..> GameConfig : tests
SingletonTest ..> RandomSource : tests

SkeletonTest ..> GameWorld : tests

StateTest ..> MonsterState : tests lifecycle
StateTest ..> Monster : tests transitions
StateTest ..> GameState : tests modes
StateTest ..> GameContext : tests mode changes
StateTest ..> CommandParser : tests command availability

StrategyObserverTest ..> CombatStrategy : tests
StrategyObserverTest ..> Combat : tests
StrategyObserverTest ..> EventBus : tests
StrategyObserverTest ..> GameEventListener : tests

%% Pattern labels and nested type names

note for MonsterState "STATE: monster lifecycle. Monster is the context."
note for GameState "STATE: game modes. GameContext is the context."
note for CombatStrategy "STRATEGY: how a monster acts. Independent of its lifecycle state."
note for Command "COMMAND: actions are objects with execute and undo."
note for MacroCommand "MACRO COMMAND: combines commands through the Command interface."
note for NoCommand "NULL OBJECT: rejected input still returns a Command."
note for TurnSnapshot "MEMENTO: captures and restores the state of a turn."
note for AbstractCommand "TEMPLATE METHOD: execute surrounds doExecute with shared turn handling."
note for EventBus "OBSERVER: publishes events to registered listeners."
note for ThemeKit "ABSTRACT FACTORY: creates a consistent family of themed products."
note for RoomPopulator "FACTORY METHOD: subclasses supply encounters. populate is a template method."
note for MonsterFactory "SIMPLE FACTORY: creates monsters from registered data definitions."
note for GameConfig "SINGLETON: private constructor and shared getInstance."
note for RandomSource "SINGLETON: shared seeded random source."
note for ActionType "Nested Java enum: Action.Type."
note for SimpleCommandBody "Nested Java interface: SimpleCommand.Body."
note for ConsolePrinter "Nested Java class: Main.ConsolePrinter."